1
00:00:00,640 --> 00:00:03,000
Hello everyone, my name is He Qianhua.

2
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:13,080
 The character Qian means beautiful and talented, while the character Hua resembles the Asian character for flower and symbolize blooming and gorgeous.

3
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:18,680
 As you may notice, each character in my name has a single person next to it.

4
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:25,360
 So I think my parents want me to grow into a person who is beautiful, gorgeous and talented. 

5
00:00:25,690 --> 00:00:33,370
Like the lively flower bloom in the spring, and I would also like to bring a touch of gorgeousness to every aspect of my life.

6
00:00:33,850 --> 00:00:34,570
 Thank you. 
